{
  "_comment": [
    "Touch rule for scripts/ci/check-docs-drift.py --touch (docs/docs-drift-gate.md).",
    "A PR changing a file matched by a rule's `code` globs must change at least one of its `docs`,",
    "or state `doc-coupling-exempt: <id> — <reason>` in the PR body.",
    "Globs: ** crosses '/', * and ? do not, {a,b} alternates. agents/plugins/*/src/** is owned by",
    "the plugin README touch rule and must not appear here. Every glob must match a file."
